  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of Horticulture and Horticultural Entrepreneurship in Chad (HortiHub Chad)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the HortiHub Chad project is to support transforming the horticulture sector in the Ndjamena and Bahr Linia region in Chad by addressing horticulture and entrepreneurship challenges. The project focuses on enhancing horticultural productivity, fostering agripreneurship (including women and youth) and reducing post-harvest losses.These objectives are pursued by setting up a self-supporting social enterprise (HortiHub Chad) to provide services to farmers (&#x2018;From project to sustainable social enterprise&#x2019;). The goal is to have a HortiHub that is sustainable and self-supporting. In this HortiHub, partners have a participation. This will be in financial and/or technical and/or personnel terms.</narrative>
  </description>
